== K1: derivations (sympy) ==
  D1 H1 background: u = 3*c2*epsilon/5 * f  (X24b's Q = eps H rho_L c^2 form gives c2*epsilon/5 * f); c_s ~ a^3/2  =>  X22 p = 2
  D2 power key S ~ f^n: p = 3*n/2 + 1/2;  p >= 3 needs n >= 5/3
  D3 d2H/dx2 = Derivative(Phi(x, t), (x, 2));  d2H/dxdp = B(t);  d2H/dp2 = A(t)
     Riccati for M = dp/dx along the sheet: dM/dt = -Hpp M^2 - 2 Hxp M - Hxx. The drive enters only Hpp and Hxp
     (identity-proportional rescaling); folds (multi-stream, dispersion) are sourced only by Hxx = Phi''.
  D4 drive heating d(sigma^2)/dt = 2*Gamma*sigma2: proportional to sigma^2 (scale-free)  =>  c_s = A(t) sigma, r = 1
  D5 v_res = 2*sqrt(D)*sqrt(Gamma_d);  with D <= v_f/k_f:  v <= 2*sqrt(Gamma_d)*sqrt(v_f)/sqrt(k_f)
